      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَّبَحٌ</span></b> , applied to a [garment of the kind called]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِسَآء</span>, <i>Strong,</i> or <i>stout:</i> (O, K: *) or, as some
say, <i>wide.</i> (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [applied to a stick, or
piece of wood,] <i>Pared,</i> (K, TA,) and <i>cut,</i> or
<i>hewed</i> [app. <i>so as to be made wide:</i> see 1]. (TA.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>A species of fish..</i> (TA.)

